      <cyrillic>харамсах</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XARAMSA-</transcript>
      <definition>[= xaramca-] v. t. To be jealous of; to be possessive; to regret; to pity.</definition>
      <page>934</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮᠰᠠᠨ ᠭᠠᠰᠢᠭᠤᠳᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>--n γasiγudaxu</transcript>
          <definition> To regret, grieve.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠬᠠᠷᠠᠮᠰᠠᠬᠣᠢ ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠯ</unicode>
          <transcript>--xui sedkil</transcript>
          <definition> Jealous thought, jealousy.</definition>
